msgid "Adds a \"Who can see\" rule to every product (Tiered Pricing tab, Additional Options) and every product category (category screen): everyone, only the selected roles, or everyone except the selected roles; guests count as a role. Use it for wholesale-only or retail-only products and categories. Hidden products leave the shop, search, related lists, menus, the sitemap and the Store API and cannot be bought. Shop managers always see everything."
